@api = http://localhost:5000

### Kiểm tra API đang chạy
GET {{api}}/

### Lấy danh sách bài tập
GET {{api}}/api/assignments

### Nộp bài hợp lệ → 201 Created
POST {{api}}/api/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{ "assignmentId": 1, "studentCode": "SV001", "repositoryUrl": "https://example.com/sv001/bai-tap-1" }

### Nộp bài thiếu studentCode → 400 Bad Request
POST {{api}}/api/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{ "assignmentId": 1, "studentCode": "", "repositoryUrl": "https://example.com/x" }
### Test 400 Bad Request - thiếu StudentCode
POST http://localhost:5000/api/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "assignmentId": 1,
    "studentCode": "",
    "repositoryUrl": "https://example.com/sv001/bai-tap-1"
}

### Test 400 Bad Request - thiếu RepositoryUrl
POST http://localhost:5000/api/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "assignmentId": 1,
    "studentCode": "SV001",
    "repositoryUrl": ""
}

### Tạo lượt nộp mới
POST http://localhost:5000/api/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "assignmentId": 1,
    "studentCode": "SV001",
    "repositoryUrl": "https://example.com/sv001/bai-tap-1"
}

### Tra cứu lượt nộp theo ID
GET http://localhost:5000/api/submissions/2c0a1929-7034-421b-aa11-9bbf98d3c166

### Kiểm tra ID không tồn tại
GET http://localhost:5000/api/submissions/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001

@queueApi = http://localhost:5001

### 1. Kiểm tra API
GET {{queueApi}}/

### 2. Gửi bài nộp vào hàng đợi
POST {{queueApi}}/api/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "assignmentId": 1,
    "studentCode": "SV001",
    "repositoryUrl": "https://example.com/sv001"
}


### Tra cứu lượt nộp có thật (200 OK)
GET http://localhost:5000/api/submissions/2c0a1929-7034-421b-aa11-9bbf98d3c166

### Tra cứu lượt nộp không tồn tại (404 Not Found)
GET http://localhost:5000/api/submissions/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001
